  "title": "Fortis Challenges SC Forensic Audit Order in Company Transactions",
  "summary": "Fortis challenges the Supreme Court's order against the High Court over allegations of asset erosion during Daiichi Sankyo enforcement proceedings. The court is seeking to address the discrepancies in financial records.",
